# Generate module 19 lesson 19 b06 deal conference scene asset

## Goal

Generate one BMH course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-19/m19_L19_b06_deal-conference.png`.

## Scope

- Match the attached BMH course doodle references.
- Keep Priya as the BMH representative: black back ponytail, orange or yellow headband, orange headset with boom mic, yellow top, cream pants, orange shoes, flat white or cream face and hands, tiny dot eyes, tiny curved cast-board nose, simple friendly mouth.
- Show a professional conference-stage deal-closer scene with Priya presenting to a packed simple doodle audience.
- Include a large blank presentation screen behind Priya with a visual flow of blank cards and arrows: offer packet card, terms sliders/card, negotiation table icon, signed contract icon.
- Keep all screen content wordless and letterless.
- Use the locked flat palette and style: cornflower-blue background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black; thick wobbly outlines; no gradients, texture, shading, shadows, lighting, perspective, or skin tones.
- Avoid Andrea, text, numbers, logos, watermarks, realistic UI, decorative filler, clutter, and clipped subjects.

## Execution

- The explicit local `gpt-image-2` CLI path is blocked because this shell has no `OPENAI_API_KEY` and no Python OpenAI SDK.
- Use the built-in image generation workflow with the same GPT Image production path used for the adjacent Priya course assets.
- Save the final selected image at 1600 x 900.
- Palette-snap the final PNG to the locked course colors if needed.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is PNG image data at 1600 x 900.
- Visually inspect for Priya identity, conference stage composition, blank offer-to-contract flow, simple audience, open blue space, and no readable text or decorative clutter.

